sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Simulator process A
    participant B as Simulator process B
    participant F as OS / checkpoint files
    A->>F: Open state.lock<br/>flock LOCK_EX with LOCK_NB
    F-->>A: Exclusive writer ownership granted
    B->>F: Open the same state.lock<br/>flock LOCK_EX with LOCK_NB
    F-->>B: Immediate lock error, do not wait
    Note over B,F: No checkpoint rewrite or sender run by this command
    A->>F: Load checkpoint, run the selected command<br/>Write temporary snapshot, fsync, rename, fsync directory
    alt Normal command completion
        A->>F: Close the lock file descriptor
    else Process exits or is killed
        F->>F: Release ownership when descriptors are closed
    end
    B->>F: Retry by opening the same lock file
    F-->>B: Exclusive ownership granted
    B->>F: Load the old or new complete checkpoint<br/>Resume with preserved event identities
    Note over A,F: Transport and financial workflow commands use this store.<br/>Different checkpoint paths have separate ownership.<br/>File locking protects the checkpoint, not database accounting.
